    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41179" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕpertor</span></b> , ōris,
			m.
		<i><span class="en">id. II. B. 2</span></i>., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a discoverer</i>, <i>inventor</i>, <i>deviser</i>, <i>author</i> (not in Cic. or Cæs.; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inventor): vitis,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Bacchus</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 2, 19</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. Am. 1, 3, 11</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mellis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. F.
					3, 762</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carminis et medicae opis, Phoebus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. R. Am. 76</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">poenae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tr. 3, 11, 51</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">medicinae,</span>”
				i.e. <i>Æsculapius</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 772</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hominum rerumque,</span>”
				i.e. <i>Jupiter</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 12, 829</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">doctrinarum atque leporum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					3, 1049</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pallae honestae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. A.
					P. 278</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">legum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 2, 16, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">novi juris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					2, 30</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">relationis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 12, 53</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">facinorum omnium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flagitii ejus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 71</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perfidiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sall. H. 4, 61, 7</span></i>
			 Dietsch; <i><span class="en">Cels. 7, 26, 3</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 7, 25</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orbis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Cath. 4, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">artis rhetoricae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Flor 4, p. 360, 12</span></i>
			 codd. (v. repertio).</div>
